00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,590
The debut era rolled on without pause.

2
00:00:02,590 --> 00:00:09,832
Award-show rotations, year-end stages, brand shoots — a full rookie campaign executed at six.

3
00:00:09,832 --> 00:00:18,608
Behind the scenes, the group's formation photographs kept one position subtly offset, the way teams do when a roster is known to change.

4
00:00:18,608 --> 00:00:21,469
Fans read the framing like weather patterns.

5
00:00:21,469 --> 00:00:28,711
The company, to its credit, never once performed the absence — no tribute edits, no sympathy messaging.

6
00:00:28,711 --> 00:00:33,208
The work carried on, and the empty chair stayed empty in silence.

